*** Begin ECU Patch
Key: 017-context-causal-workspace
Title: Make Context filesystem operations causal and path-based
Purpose: Replace public cwd/workspace plumbing with typed Context-owned paths, automatic event-file discovery, explicit materialization and publication, and causal input closure shared by agents, datasets, shell, and Git.

*** Begin Context
A Reaction now treats Events as the durable causal graph and the Context workspace as its provider-independent filesystem. given(...) resolves transitive ancestors without admitting sibling branches before fan-in. loadFiles() discovers linked $files, preserves immutable identities and origins, and materializes canonical paths. Git returns a branded logical path reused by agent, shell, commit, push, and storeFiles; provider cwd never appears in the public DX. Text and JSON files are projected to models as text while retaining their durable file header.
*** End Context

